---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Andrew Ginns"
  description="About Andrew Ginns: solutions architecture, machine learning engineering, technical leadership, and life beyond work."
>
  <div class="about-content">
    <h1>About Me</h1>

    <section class="intro">
      <p>
        I'm a {profile.role} at {profile.company}. I help customers benefit from
        AI by designing and implementing solutions around their business needs.
      </p>
      <p>
        I bridge the gap between hands-on development and strategic leadership.
        I specialise in mentoring technical teams, establishing robust MLOps
        workflows, and translating complex AI concepts for senior stakeholders.
        My focus is on building end-to-end ML solutions, from platform
        infrastructure to generative AI applications.
        <br />I am an effective support to teams both as a mentor and an extra
        pair of hands when needed. Some of the pieces of work I've done include:
      </p>
      <ul class="work-list">
        <li>
          Architecting and building a scalable ML platform to accelerate the
          model development lifecycle
        </li>
        <li>
          Leading and scaling Data Science teams to deliver revenue generating
          products
        </li>
        <li>
          Championing AI adoption by developing and delivering technical
          workshops to both engineering and business teams.
        </li>
        <li>
          Engineering robust MLOps infrastructure that made model deployment
          faster and more reliable
        </li>
        <li>
          Applying cutting-edge GenAI techniques to solve real-world problems
          like cost estimation and structured data extraction from video
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="interests">
      <h2>Beyond Work</h2>
      <p>
        Outside of machine learning, I have diverse interests that keep life
        interesting:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Travel:</strong> Exploring new cultures and cuisines,
          particularly in Southeast Asia and Europe
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technology:</strong> Home automation, homelabbing, and
          electronics projects
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Creative Pursuits:</strong> Photography, cooking, and
          experimenting with generative art
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Outdoors:</strong> Hiking, camping, and beach days
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  ul {
    list-style-position: outside;
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
